WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.782
In a few minutes, you can make your phone much safer.

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:07.418
Lock your screen with a six-digit PIN, or your fingerprint.

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:12.337
Install updates. They fix security holes that criminals use.

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:15.924
Install apps only from the official app store.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:21.060
Set a SIM PIN, turn on backups, and turn on find my device.

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:31.117
Before you move on, check: Set a screen lock. Install pending updates. Set a SIM PIN. Turn on backup and Find My Device.

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:37.118
Well done. You have finished the course. Now secure your own phone and accounts.
